 - `now` (function, optional) — clock, defaults to `Date.now`. Windows start at multiples of `windowMs`.
+
+`remaining(key)` returns the number of requests the key can still make in the current window without consuming a request. It returns zero when exhausted and resets to the key's limit at the next window, even if no request has been made yet. Rejected requests do not consume budget.
